  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large Dutch oven over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent and starting to caramelize.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for another minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the lamb mince, breaking it up with a spoon as it cooks, until it is no longer pink.",
    "Stir in the ground cumin, coriander, and cayenne pepper and cook for one minute.",
    "Add the diced tomatoes, chickpeas, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer, then reduce the heat to low and cook, covered, for 30 minutes.",
    "Serve the tagine hot, garnished with chopped fresh parsley or cilantro if desired."
